---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About CalcPath"
  description="CalcPath builds free financial calculators with clear explanations, interactive charts, and downloadable results. No signup, no ads, no data harvesting."
>
  <div class="max-w-[768px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8">About CalcPath</h1>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath exists to make financial math simple. Every calculator is free, instant, and
          private — we never ask for your data or bury results behind signup forms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">What We Do</h2>
        <p>
          We build free financial calculators with clear explanations, interactive charts, and
          downloadable results. Our tools help you see your numbers so you can make informed decisions
          — whether you're planning for retirement, comparing loan options, or figuring out how to pay
          off debt faster.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">How We're Different</h2>
        <p>
          Other financial sites gate results behind account forms or sell your information to financial
          advisors. We don't. Your calculator inputs never leave your browser — all calculations run
          locally on your device. No accounts, no data harvesting, no ad clutter.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">How We Make Money</h2>
        <p>
          We earn commissions when you click affiliate links to financial products. This costs you
          nothing extra and helps keep our tools free. We never recommend a product just to earn a
          commission — the math is the math. See our
          <a href="/disclosure" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-700 underline">
            full affiliate disclosure
          </a>
          for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">What We Don't Do</h2>
        <p>
          We don't provide personalized financial advice. We build tools that help you understand
          the math behind financial decisions. For advice tailored to your specific situation,
          consult a qualified financial advisor.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
